SUMMARY:Q2 Wine Club Pick-Up Party
DESCRIPTION:📅 Thursday\, May 21 | 5–8pm\nSpring is in full bloom\, and it’s time to gather once again for an evening of wine\, seasonal flavors\, and wonderful company at the vineyard. 🌿🌸\nJoin us for our Q2 Wine Club Pick-Up Party\, styled as Wine Club Flatbreads & Sips Night—a relaxed evening designed to celebrate fresh flavors\, estate-grown wines\, and the joy of sharing good food together.\n🎟 Ticket Includes:\n🍷 One welcome glass of wine (or non-alcoholic beverage)\n🍕 A trio of handcrafted flatbreads\n🍰 Dessert\n🍷 Pick-up of your Q2 Wine Club allocation\n✨ Flatbread Selections Include:\n🍄 Mushroom & Truffle Oil – earthy\, aromatic\, and deeply satisfying\n🍃 Fig\, Prosciutto & Arugula – sweet\, savory\, and fresh\n🍋 Olive Tapenade & Lemon Ricotta – bright\, briny\, and beautifully creamy\n🍰 Plus a simple seasonal dessert to end the evening on a sweet note\nSpend the evening mingling with fellow club members\, discovering new pairings\, and enjoying the relaxed beauty of the vineyard in springtime. Additional wine will be available for purchase by the glass or bottle if you’d like to linger a little longer.\n🎉 Ticket Information:\n🍷 Wine Club Members: Complimentary as part of your Q2 pick-up benefits\n👫 Partners & Additional Guests: $25.60 per person with Wine Club discount (Regular price $40)\n⚠️ Please log in at checkout to receive member pricing on additional tickets.\nNot a Wine Club member yet? Join today and enjoy exclusive gatherings like this throughout the year—filled with thoughtful wines\, seasonal food\, and a welcoming community.\n📌 Reservations required so we can prepare adequate food.\nWe can’t wait to raise a glass with you!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/q2-wine-club-pick-up-party/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards (Great Bear)\, 24800 County Rd 101A
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/5-21-26-Thumbnail.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
GEO:38.5818013;-121.7499687
